        "subheading_3": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>I started printing at my kitchen table with a sponge and a spoon. Ten years later it is a small room with a proper press, and it is still just me in it.</p><p>Everything here starts as a drawing. Some drawings become prints and totes, some become brushes and wallpapers you can download, and the way I make all of them is in the course.</p>"
          }
        },
